linkrd (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Install the upstream udev rule (70-linkrd.rules) and systemd user unit;
    the user unit is installed but not enabled.
  * Ship man/linkrd.1, generated from the upstream command-line definition.
  * Upstream does not provide a LICENSE file or a Cargo.toml license field
    yet; debian/copyright therefore records the license as "unknown" and
    this package is not ready for an upload to the Debian archive.

